CodeGraph additions
-------------------
*-calls.scm files are written for CodeGraph (same license as this project). They
add @reference.call captures the official tags queries lack: all calls for C, C++
and Swift; path calls (Type::new()) for Rust; JSX component usage (jsx-calls.scm)
for JavaScript and TSX.
